    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O'Ragallaig - Tig Beag\r\n3 Main Street\r\nArdmore\r\nCo Waterford\r\nP36CX43\r\n\r\nJoint Selling Agents: Keogh Auctioneers Youghal and Ronan King Auctioneers Dungarvan are delighted to offer O'Ragallaig - Tig Beag, 3 Main Street, Ardmore, Co Waterford for Sale by Private Treaty.\r\n\r\nThis Landmark property is superbly situated in the heart of Ardmore Village - opposite The Whitehorses Restaurant - and within a short level stroll of the white sandy beach of Ardmore Strand and the Atlantic Ocean.\r\n\r\nArdmore Village itself is a much sought after location to both live in and visit as it is one of the prettiest seaside villages along the southern coast - it is renowned for its dramatic coastline, safe sandy beach, Cliff Walk and as a treasure trove of heritage sites including its iconic Round Tower. Being such a popular destination it also offers lovely restaurants, bars, gallery shops and a 5 star hotel, to name but a few of its attractions. The local area is dotted with fabulous coves and beaches including Goat Island, Whiting Bay and the Curragh. The large towns of Youghal and Dungarvan are within c15 minutes' drive and the cities of Cork and Waterford are within an hour's drive. There is a convenient Local Link Bus connecting the towns and local villages.\r\n\r\nO'Ragallaig - Tig Beag presents to market as a substantial two storied building in the centre of the village on a sizable circa 0.2 acres.\r\n\r\nThe property was a Bar/Lounge with Living Accommodation on the ground floor and 1st Floor and has been vacant for a number of years. The current internal configuration comprises of: \r\nGround Floor: Entrance Hall with the Bar area on the Left hand side including a Snug, Bar and Lounge, External WC. The residence is on the Right Hand Side  and includes: Living Room, Kitchen and Store Room.\r\n1st Floor: Five Bedrooms and a Bathroom\r\nThere is a large garden area at the rear which enjoys a southerly aspect.\r\n\r\nThe property may benefit from the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant or the Vacant Above the Shop Grant \r\n\r\nThis property presents as a rare opportunity to acquire a large property in the heart of a very sought after seaside village and which offers the discerning buyer a myriad of options for use. Viewing is undoubtably highly recommended."
      },
